      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/ecb155/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-05T02:21:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Understand that, and the invader board (and the event board) are really cool looking and thematic etc, but if they had put the fear cards from left to right, instead from top to bottom, and re-arranged the board around that, as well as shrinking hte \"fear\" area, they could have saved in a good bit of space tbh. It wouldn't look so thematic though.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Might just draw up my own simple one on the PC and print it out, and test playing with it.</p>",
