      "created_at": "2019-03-05T03:13:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The idea of a playmat invader board has been brought up in the past. I think the decision might have just been to focus on the tweaks that needed to happen to the Thematic Island one for this go-around. (Jagged Earth had enough going on already!)</p>\n<p>I think that the at least one more expansion Eric has said he'd like to do is probably a safe bet, and I'll try to remember to bring it up when that starts getting serious discussion. That'll be a while, though.</p>",
